ing (SBC) is a founder-led advisory firm headquartered in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, working with education institutions, skill centres, promoters and founder-led businesses across Gujarat on institution building, strategic research and feasibility, and business operations.","email":"consulting@sbcgroup.in","telephone":"+91-8128310116","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Ahmedabad","addressRegion":"Gujarat","addressCountry":"IN"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"City","name":"Ahmedabad"},{"@type":"State","name":"Gujarat"},{"@type":"Country","name":"India"}],"founder":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sagar Burse","honorificSuffix":"PhD","jobTitle":"Founder & Principal Consultant","url":"https://sbcgroup.in/founder","image":"https://sbcgroup.in/images/founder/sagar-burse-author.webp","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsagarburse/"]},"knowsAbout":["Institution building","Skill development","Feasibility studies","Market research","Business operations consulting","MSME consulting","Business process improvement","Business process management","SOP design","GAP360 gap analysis"],"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/sbcglobal/","https://www.facebook.com/sbcgroup.in","https://www.instagram.com/sbcgroup.in"]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","serviceType":"Institution setup and skill development consulting","name":"Skill Institute & College Setup Consulting","provider":{"@id":"https://sbcgroup.in/#professional-service"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"State","name":"Gujarat"},{"@type":"City","name":"Ahmedabad"}],"description":"Setup, NSDC affiliation, approvals, DPRs and staff structuring for skill institutes and colleges in Gujarat. Talk to Dr. Sagar Burse."}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does it take to set up a skill training centre and get NSDC affiliation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on the type of centre, the sector and the state process, so we do not quote one standard number. The fixed-fee diagnostic gives you a written timeline for your specific route before you commit to the full project."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you charge for institute setup consulting?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We start with a fixed-fee diagnostic. After that, the fee for the full project is quoted against a written scope, so you know what is included before you proceed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work only with skill institutes, or with colleges as well?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both. We work with skill development centres and training partners, and with trusts planning a new college or adding programmes. The route differs: NSDC and Sector Skill Councils for skilling; state authorities, AICTE or UGC for colleges. We start by confirming which route applies to you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you guarantee approval or affiliation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Approval decisions are made by the regulator or the affiliating body. We prepare the application, the documentation and the sequence so that it is complete and correct."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What do you need from us to begin?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your trust or company details, the location and premises plan, the programmes or sectors you have in mind, your budget range and any approvals already in hand. A short call with Dr. Sagar is enough to start."}}]}</script><header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-ink-tint bg-paper/95 backdrop-blur"><div class="shell flex h-20 items-center justify-between gap-6 lg:h-28"><a href="/" class="flex min-w-0 shrink-0 items-center"><img src="/sbc-logo.png" alt="Sagar Burse Consulting SBC logo" width="96" height="96" class="size-14 shrink-0 rounded-full sm:size-16 lg:size-24"/></a><nav aria-label="Main" class="hidden items-center gap-2 lg:flex"><div 