"M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="bg-ink"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Institution Building & Skill Development"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="shell py-3 text-paper/70 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Institution Building &amp; Skill Development</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[3rem]">Setting up or expanding an institute? Get the setup, approvals and structure right.</h1><p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-paper/80">SBC is a founder-led advisory firm in Ahmedabad. We help trustees, promoters and directors set up skill development centres, training partner institutes and colleges in Gujarat, from the first roadmap through NSDC affiliation and approvals to a working organisation.</p><div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://wa.me/918128310116?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Burse%2C%20I%E2%80%99d%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg> WhatsApp Dr. Sagar Burse</a><a href="tel:+918128310116" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-ink-tint px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:border-gold hover:text-gold"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-phone size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384"></path></svg> Call +91 81283 10116</a></div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Where institute setup projects usually get stuck</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The approval route is chosen late, so documents and timelines are redone.</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The DPR is written for the regulator or the bank, but never answers the trustees&#x27; own question: will this institute fill and sustain itself?</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">NSDC training partner registration and Sector Skill Council (SSC) affiliation are treated as paperwork, when each needs trainers, infrastructure and curriculum already in place.</div><div class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Staff are hired before roles, KRAs and a performance system exist, so the institute opens without a clear way to manage its people.</div></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">What We Deliver</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Institute setup roadmap</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A phased plan for a skill development centre, training institute or college: what to build, in what order, and which approvals each phase needs.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-scroll-text size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 12h-5"></path><path d="M15 8h-5"></path><path d="M19 17V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4"></path><path d="M8 21h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-1a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H11a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v1a2 2 0 1 1-4 0V5a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">NSDC and SSC affiliation support</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Preparation and documentation for NSDC training partner registration and Sector Skill Council affiliation, including PMKVY training centre requirements.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clipboard-check size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"></rect><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="m9 14 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Approvals documentation</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The documents and the sequence for state and regulator approvals, including AICTE and UGC where a college is involved.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">DPRs for skill centres and colleges</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A detailed project report covering demand, programmes, infrastructure, staffing and financial viability, written for trustees as well as regulators and lenders.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-landmark size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 18v-7"></path><path d="M11.12 2.198a2 2 0 0 1 1.76.006l7.866 3.847c.476.233.31.949-.22.949H3.474c-.53 0-.695-.716-.22-.949z"></path><path d="M14 18v-7"></path><path d="M18 18v-7"></path><path d="M3 22h18"></path><path d="M6 18v-7"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Organisation structure</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Governance, reporting lines and the key positions the institute needs at launch.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Roles, KRAs and PMS for staff</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Role descriptions, KRAs and a performance management system, so every staff member knows what is expected from the first day.</p></article></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">How We Work</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-9"><ol class="divide-y divide-ink-tint border-t border-ink-tint"><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">01</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Fixed-fee diagnostic</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">A short, fixed-fee assessment of your goal, location, budget and approval route. You receive a written roadmap, and a proposed scope and fee for the full project.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">02</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Plan and prepare</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">The DPR, approvals documentation and organisation structure, built together with your trustees or promoters.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-6"><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 sm:w-56"><span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-gold text-[12px] font-semibold text-gold">03</span><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-ink">Support through launch</h3></div><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal sm:flex-1">Liaison and documentation support through affiliation and approvals, and operational readiness for the first batch.</p></li></ol></section></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Case summary · Institution Building · Ongoing</p><h2 class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">A new skill institute, from plan to operation</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">The problem</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A new skill institute had to move from a plan to an affiliated, operating centre, which meant liaison with government and preparation for NSDC affiliation.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">The work done</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Government liaison, NSDC affiliation preparation and operationalising the new institute.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><h3 class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft">The outcome</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The engagement is in progress, with affiliation preparation and operational set-up under way. We will publish the result when it concludes.</p></article></section><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-6"><a href="/case-studies/skill-institution-set-up" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read the full case study →</a><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client identity is withheld for confidentiality. References available on request.</p></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">SBC Engagements</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="flex flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-6"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-deep">Institution Building</p><span class="shrink-0 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] bg-gold/10 text-gold-deep">Ongoing</span></div><h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Skill Institution Set-up</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Government liaison, NSDC affiliation preparation, and operationalising a new skill institute.</p><p class="mt-4 text-[12px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client references available on request.</p><a href="/case-studies/skill-institution-set-up" class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View details <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></article></section><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-6"><a href="/case-studies" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View all case studies →</a></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">About Dr. Sagar Burse</h2><div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><p>Dr. Sagar Burse holds a PhD in Management and advises higher-education and skill institutions in Gujarat. Every SBC engagement is led by him personally, so you speak to the person doing the work.</p><p>Before founding SBC in 2025, he worked on institution-building engagements for a public university, a public-sector centre of excellence and a private university, as part of the advisory teams he was employed with.</p></div><a href="/founder" class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Read Dr. Burse’s full profile →</a></section></div></section><section aria-labelledby="founder-experience-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="founder-experience-heading" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Founder’s Prior Experience</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Engagements Dr. Sagar Burse worked on before founding SBC, as part of the advisory teams he was employed with. Client details are withheld for confidentiality.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-6"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Founder’s Prior Experience</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Public University</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Vision, strategic roadmap, AICTE/UGC compliance, curriculum design, governance and internationalisation, from concept to launch.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-6"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Founder’s Prior Experience</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Public Sector Centre of Excellence</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Institutional positioning, sector curriculum design, industry and international partnerships, governance and compliance framework.</p></article><article class="border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-6"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold">Founder’s Prior Experience</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Private University</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Vision and strategic framework, AICTE/UGC affiliation support, NEP 2020 curriculum design, governance and leadership recruitment.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><style>.faq-item summary{list-style:none}.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq-item .faq-chev{transition:transform .2s}.faq-item[open] .faq-chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}.faq-item summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:-2px}</style><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)] lg:items-start"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="faq" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Questions trustees and promoters ask us</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tap a question to see the answer.</p></section><div class="space-y-4"><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How long does it take to set up a skill training centre and get NSDC affiliation?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">It depends on the type of centre, the sector and the state process, so we do not quote one standard number. The fixed-fee diagnostic gives you a written timeline for your specific route before you commit to the full project.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">How do you charge for institute setup consulting?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">We start with a fixed-fee diagnostic. After that, the fee for the full project is quoted against a written scope, so you know what is included before you proceed.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Do you work only with skill institutes, or with colleges as well?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Both. We work with skill development centres and training partners, and with trusts planning a new college or adding programmes. The route differs: NSDC and Sector Skill Councils for skilling; state authorities, AICTE or UGC for colleges. We start by confirming which route applies to you.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Can you guarantee approval or affiliation?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">No. Approval decisions are made by the regulator or the affiliating body. We prepare the application, the documentation and the sequence so that it is complete and correct.</p></div></details><details name="faq" class="faq-item border border-ink-tint bg-card"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5"><h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">What do you need from us to begin?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down faq-chev size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></summary><div class="border-t border-ink-tint p-5"><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Your trust or company details, the location and premises plan, the programmes or sectors you have in mind, your budget range and any approvals already in hand. A short call with Dr. Sagar is enough to start.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.3fr)] lg:items-start"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Talk to Dr. Sagar Burse</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tell us about the institute you are planning. You will speak directly with Dr. Sagar Burse, not a sales team.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="https://wa.me/918128310116?text=Hello%20Dr.%20Burse%2C%20I%E2%80%99d%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20project." target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-circle size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719"></path></svg> WhatsApp</a><a href="tel:+918128310116" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-ink-tint px-6 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1